# 统一按 LF 存储，避免 Windows 开发者提交后整个文件显示"被修改"
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本保留 CRLF，否则在某些 cmd 环境下会出问题
*.bat   text eol=crlf
*.cmd   text eol=crlf
*.ps1   text eol=crlf
*.sh    text eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做换行转换，也不参与 diff
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.jar   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary

# GitHub 语言统计：把前端算进去，别让仓库被识别成纯 Java
*.html  linguist-language=HTML
*.css   linguist-language=CSS
*.js    linguist-language=JavaScript

# 文档和 SQL 在 diff 里正常显示
*.md    text
*.sql   text
